    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Welcome to Heji</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_description">This is a simple and easy-to-use item management tool that helps you easily manage your items, containers, and reminders. Let\'s get started!</string>
    <string name="onboarding_home_area_title">Home Area</string>
    <string name="onboarding_home_area_description">The home screen displays your statistics, including total items, number of containers, and items to purchase. On the left is the container list—tap to view items in different containers. At the top, there are search and scan features for quickly finding and adding items.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_add_warehouse_title">Add Container</string>
    <string name="onboarding_add_warehouse_description">Tap the \"+\" button at the bottom of the container list on the left to add a new container. Containers help you categorize and manage items, such as \"Kitchen\", \"Bedroom\", or \"Office\". You can also create sub-containers for more detailed organization.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_add_item_title">Add Item</string>
    <string name="onboarding_add_item_description">Tap the \"+\" button in the bottom right corner to add a new item. When adding an item, you can set the name, quantity, price, expiration date, and more. After selecting a container, the item will automatically be categorized into it.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_settings_title">Settings</string>
    <string name="onboarding_settings_description">Tap the menu button in the top left corner to open Settings. In Settings, you can:\n• Customize appearance themes and colors\n• Configure reminder functions\n• Manage containers and categories\n• Back up and restore data\n• Set up cloud sync\n• Switch languages</string>
    <string name="onboarding_complete_title">Get Started</string>
    <string name="onboarding_complete_description">You\'ve now learned the basic features and can start using Heji to manage your items! If you have any questions, feel free to check the help information in Settings anytime.</string>
